kiwix-search
Usage: kiwix-search ZIM.zim 'QUERY'

Greps a .zim archive straight from the command line -- no server, no browser.
The fast way to pull an answer out of an offline wikipedia or a field manual
when you just need the text.

	kiwix-search wiki.zim 'first aid'    search an archive for a phrase

See also: kiwix-serve, rg, links
